value%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20if%28value.%24%3D%3D%3D%27object%27%29return%20%7B%24%3A%27propertyKeyInvalid%27%2Creason%3A%27a%20completed%20primitive%20conversion%20cannot%20contain%20an%20Object%27%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20const%20spelling%3DreadJavaScriptPrimitivePropertyKeySpelling%28value%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20if%28spelling.length%3E1048576%29return%20%7B%24%3A%27propertyKeyInvalid%27%2Creason%3A%27property%20key%20text%20exceeds%20the%20explicit%20UTF16%20unit%20budget%27%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20const%20units%3D%5B%5D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20for%28let%20index%3D0%3Bindex%3Cspelling.length%3Bindex%2B%3D1%29units.push%28spelling.charCodeAt%28index%29%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20%7B%24%3A%27propertyKeyCompleted%27%2Ckey%3A%7B%24%3A%27text%27%2Cunits%7D%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20%40param%20%7BJavaScriptOrdinaryHeap%7D%20heap%20%40param%20%7BJavaScriptSemanticValue%7D%20input%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7BJavaScriptSemanticValue%7D%20exoticKey%20%40returns%20%7BJavaScriptPropertyKeyConversionTransition%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20beginJavaScriptPropertyKeyConversion%28heap%2Cinput%2CexoticKey%29%7B%0A%20%20return%20finishJavaScriptPropertyKeyConversion%28beginJavaScriptPrimitiveConversion%28heap%2Cinput%2CexoticKey%2C%27string%27%29%29%3B%0A%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20%40param%20%7BJavaScriptOrdinaryHeap%7D%20heap%20%40param%20%7BJavaScriptPrimitiveConversionState%7D%20state%0A%20%2A%20%40returns%20%7BJavaScriptPropertyKeyConversionTransition%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20stepJavaScriptPropertyKeyConversion%28heap%2Cstate%29%7B%0A%20%20if%28state.hint%21%3D%3D%27string%27%29return%20%7B%24%3A%27propertyKeyInvalid%27%2Creason%3A%27a%20property%20key%20continuation%20retains%20its%20actual%20string%20hint%27%7D%3B%0A%20%20return%20finishJavaScriptPropertyKeyConversion%28stepJavaScriptPrimitiveConversion%28heap%2Cstate%29%29%3B%0A%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20%40param%20%7BJavaScriptOrdinaryHeap%7D%20heap%20%40param%20%7BJavaScriptPrimit